Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 19:45:30 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] jay: resolve parallel copy cycles by rotation instead
 of swaps

A cycle of k registers took k-1 swaps of 3 moves each. Rotating it through
one temporary takes k+1 moves. The cycle is broken at an edge that would
need a split copy, since the temporary is stride 4.

Generated-by: LLM
